                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has returned the wickedness of Nabal on his own head.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David sent and proposed to Abigail, to take her as his wife. "
                        }
